Hi,

Thanks for joining Louis Andrada's Newsletter mailing list =97 glad to have=
 you here.

Here's what being on the newsletter means:

- You'll be the first to know whenever new artwork goes up on the
  website, complete with images and details.

- You're automatically entered into the monthly print draw, which
  takes place on the 1st of every month. One winner is chosen at
  random and receives a print of their choice from available work.

- You're also entered into the annual original artwork draw, which
  takes place on January 1st each year. One winner receives an
  original piece.

- You'll get personal invitations to private viewings, studio visits,
  and exhibitions before they're announced publicly.

No spam, no noise, just art, occasional updates, and a couple of chances to=
 win something along the way.

To learn more about how your information is handled, visit the privacy poli=
cy: www.louisandrada.com/privacy<http://www.louisandrada.com/privacy>
To unsubscribe at any time, visit: www.louisandrada.com/unsubscribe<http://=
www.louisandrada.com/unsubscribe>

Thanks again for being here.




Louis Andrada
Artist
Toronto, ON, Canada
Email: louis.andrada@outlook.com<mailto:luis7andrada@outlook.com>
Portfolio: www.louisandrada.com<http://www.louisandrada.com/>
Instagram: @louisandrada<https://www.instagram.com/louisandrada>

